      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T08:24:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, so it sounds like this isn\u0027t perfect, but \u003c\u003d in all cases.\n\nThe other option we could do is instead of saving the diff to dist, we could save the staged_files.json intermediate to dist, and make compare-target-files use that.  I\u0027m ambivalent.\n\nThe next thing I think we should do after this change, and some upcoming thing we\u0027re thinking about for identifying code-under-test, is to join modified_files.json with module-info.json, and see at a more granular level which tests need to run.  If we wanted to do that based on the staged_files.json, that could work too.\n\nThe other thing in my head here is that we could do a local version of the test filtering too, inside atest and/or makepush, but let\u0027s not get too ahead of ourselves. I say we proceed with this CL and iterate from there.",
      "parentUuid": "783bf9d3_b008e702",
